@startuml
title SC-ORD-006 — The payment does not answer but was captured
participant "Order\n(saga)" as O
participant "Inventory" as I
participant "Payment" as P
participant "Payment\nprovider" as PSP
participant "Notification" as N

O ->> I : ReserveStock
I ->> O : StockReserved
O ->> P : ChargePayment
P -> PSP : charge
note over PSP #ECEFF1 : captures,\nbut the answer is lost
... order deadline ...
O -> O : order deadline reached
note over O : CANCELING_PAYMENT
O ->> P : CancelPayment
P -> PSP : cancel, same reference
PSP --> P : already captured
P ->> O : PaymentCaptured
note over O : CONFIRMING_STOCK
O ->> I : ConfirmReservation
I ->> O : ReservationConfirmed
note over O #C8E6C9 : COMPLETED\norder CONFIRMED
O ->> N : OrderConfirmed
@enduml
